talent. Businesses looking for a freelancer or agency can browse profiles, compare specialties such as SEO, social media, or branding, and reach out to candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Directories like this save time in the first round of research, though quality varies and vetting is the buyer&amp;rsquo;s job. Check portfolios, references, and contracts before hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Independent information is limited. The platform is free to browse. Alternatives include Clutch, Upwork, Fiverr, DesignRush, and Sortlist. Marketinguys suits businesses looking for marketing help.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>